; Restored 2026-11-18. TUNING.md: the poses carry no sword -- they are
; walker-ninja's unarmed martial poses, and the author saw it in play
; before any test did. 0 degrees is the blade pointing straight UP out
; of the hand, positive is clockwise, which for a figure facing right is
; forward. Rig.scale.x mirrors the whole arm, so one set of keys is
; correct in both facings.
